=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> board[nr][nc] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '#'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nr, nc, child);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    board[row][col] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ch;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (child.children.size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      node.children.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ch);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i, j, root);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>代码中有几个重要的优化细节：</p>\n<p><strong>优化 1：在节点上存储完整单词（<code>word</code> 字段）</strong></p>\n<p>传统做法是 <code>isEnd</code> 标记 + 沿路径拼接字符。直接在终端节点存储完整单词可以避免路径拼接的开销，代码也更简洁。</p>\n<p><strong>优化 2：找到单词后置空（<code>child.word = null</code>）</strong></p>\n<p>防止同一个单词被多次添加到结果中。不同的网格路径可能拼出同一个单词，置空保证结果去重。</p>\n<p><strong>优化 3：渐进式 Trie 剪枝（删除叶子节点）</strong></p>\n<p>当一个 Trie 节点的所有子节点都被删除后（说明该子树的所有单词都已找到），将其从父节点中移除。这使得后续搜索不再进入已经&quot;用完&quot;的分支，显著减少搜索空间。</p>\n<p><strong>优化 4：原地标记防止重复访问</strong></p>\n<p>用 <code>board[row][col] = &#39;#&#39;</code> 标记已访问格子，回溯时恢复。这比使用 <code>visited</code> 数组更节省空间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>O(M × N × 4^L)</td>\n<td>L 为最长单词长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间</td>\n<td>O(W × L + M × N)</td>\n<td>Trie 空间 + 递归栈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度说明：</strong> 从每个格子开始 DFS，每步有 4 个方向可选（实际不会回头，所以是 3 个方向）。搜索深度为最长单词长度 <code>L</code>。Trie 的剪枝使得实际分支数远小于理论值。在有大量共享前缀的单词集合中，Trie 的剪枝效果尤为显著。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度说明：</strong> Trie 存储所有单词，空间为 O(W × L)。DFS 递归栈深度为 O(L)。不需要额外的 visited 数组。</p>\n<p><strong>与 LC 79 的对比：</strong> LC 79（单词搜索）是在网格中搜索单个单词，直接 DFS 即可。LC 212 是搜索多个单词，使用 Trie 可以将多次独立搜索合并为一次搜索，这是一个从&quot;线性扫描&quot;到&quot;索引查找&quot;的经典优化模式。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 212 单词搜索 II","id":"leetcode-212-单词搜索-ii"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 211 添加与搜索单词","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-advanced-ds/lc0211-design-add-search-words"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 128 最长连续序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-advanced-ds/lc0128-longest-consecutive-sequence"}}